<title>ITALY: Italian bank Credem 96 provisional net up 43 pct.</title>
<headline>Italian bank Credem 96 provisional net up 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bank Credito Emiliano SpA (Credem), which controls financial holding Euromobiliare, said provisional data showed it posted 1996 net profit of 56 billion lire, up 43.3 percent on 1995.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that gross operating profit rose 18.8 percent to 184 billion lire while return on equity at 8.3 percent was up 2.4 percent on 1995.</p>
<p>Total deposits rose 13.6 percent to 22.69 trillion lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
